    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d306">

                <pb facs="0430" n="314" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg314"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1715.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Johnson to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]<anchor n="8" xml:id="d306-f1"
                        /></seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-14T08:00:00-04:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 14, 1915—8 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Heavy inroads on funds appropriated for other purposes have been made for war
                    operations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
